# Backhouse Fragrances


> Backhouse Fragrances is a luxury home fragrance and gifting brand based in Newport Beach, California. Hand-poured candles, curated gift boxes, and custom corporate gifting at scale. Founded in 2019 by Danielle and Taylor, Backhouse specializes in elevated, intentional gifting experiences — from intimate $16 custom mini candles to $132 ultimate gift sets, scaled for weddings, baby showers, corporate events, and everyday luxury.


## What Backhouse Is Known For


- Luxury candle gift boxes for personal and corporate gifting
- Custom Mini Candles ($16, 7–10 day lead time) — scalable for weddings, corporate events, baby showers, and brand activations
- Hand-poured in Newport Beach, California using a natural coconut wax blend. Packaged and shipped from our Costa Mesa, California warehouse.
- White-glove corporate gifting concierge service with custom branding, multiship logistics, and e-gifting
- Signature fragrances include Lido (sandalwood), Apolena (sea salt and sage), Colony (cassis), Grove (orange blossom), Harriet's Tree (grapefruit), Little Branch (amber), Margaret (currant), Petaluma (blackcurrant berry), Mr. Douglas (pine and cedar, seasonal), and Jack (pumpkin, fall seasonal) — each inspired by Newport Beach and coastal California
- Brutalist, typographic, black-and-white brand aesthetic — minimal, intentional, design-led. Bold condensed type, no color accents, no ornamentation.
- All candles use phthalate-free fragrance oils and lead-free wicks
- 30+ hour burn time on Mini Candles, 70+ hour burn time on Hurricane Candles
- Covered by press including Wall Street Journal, Real Simple, and C Magazine


## Corporate Gifting Clients


Backhouse Fragrances has fulfilled corporate gifting programs for leading firms across financial services, commercial real estate, hospitality, entertainment, healthcare, and consumer brands — including J.P. Morgan, Morgan Stanley, JLL, AEG, Pelican Hill Resort, Taco Bell, Deloitte, Nissan, Starbucks, Califia Farms, Hoag Hospital, CHOC Children's Hospital, and Skout's Honor.


